<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICAN SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICAN SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>third day of four-day Supersport series cricket matches on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>In Pretoria: Natal 360 and 261-9 declared (Dale Benkenstein</p>
<p>87). Northerns 121 and 129-3 (Richie Richardson 48 not out).</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal won by an innings and three runs.</p>
<p>Transvaal 308. Boland 146 (Clive Eksteen 4-38) and 159 (Ross</p>
<p>Veenstra 4-48).</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Western Province 446. Free State 280</p>
<p>(Gerhardus Liebenberg 90; Meyrick Pringle 4-61, Aubrey Martyn</p>
<p>4-76)and 205-2 (Gerhardus Liebenberg 91, Deon Jordaan 80).</p>
<p>In Port Elizabeth: Eastern Province 476-6 declared and 185-3</p>
<p>declared (Kepler Wessels 64 not out). Griqualand West 266</p>
<p>(Mickey Arthur 86; Eldine Baptiste 5-60) and 104-3.</p>
</text>
